query:
UPDATE articles 
SET content = '[
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "As many of us remember from our early design days, we started with tactile portfolios—those carefully mounted images we''d bring to showcases. Fast forward to 2026, and our digital platform has taken center stage. But before we dive into SEO and content, let''s chat about structuring your site—because even the best set needs a solid blueprint."
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "Start with a Clear Site Structure"
  },
  {
    "type": "image",
    "url": "https://files.manuscdn.com/user_upload_by_module/session_file/310519663337866878/LmDwyQxkOOMtaGWW.png",
    "alt": "Website sitemap structure floating in digital clouds showing clear navigation hierarchy",
    "caption": "A well-organized site structure helps both users and search engines navigate your portfolio"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "Think of it this way: while we might love giving our pages dramatic names, search engines are like that friend who just wants to know where the snacks are. If you call it \"Projects\" instead of \"Productions,\" or \"About\" instead of something fancy, they''ll find everything faster. In other words, keep it simple and you''ll have a happy search engine. They''re essentially looking at your site like an American business directory, so the more universal the terms, the better."
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "Why SEO and Content Matter"
  },
  {
    "type": "image",
    "url": "https://files.manuscdn.com/user_upload_by_module/session_file/310519663337866878/lnVhwoVqUbVUlHSC.png",
    "alt": "Glowing search magnifying glass floating above cloud formations representing SEO optimization",
    "caption": "SEO helps your portfolio become discoverable in search results"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "Now that we''ve got the structure down, let''s talk content. SEO—search engine optimization—helps your site become discoverable. Add about 300 words of thoughtful content to each project page to tell the story behind your work. Include a strong About Me section and a downloadable resume to round out your digital platform. It''s all about making your site as clear and informative as possible—with a little personality, of course."
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "Using a \"News\" Approach for Blogging"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "You don''t have to be a full-time blogger. Think of a \"news\" section as a place for quick updates. Announce new projects, share behind-the-scenes photos, and link to reviews. It''s all about tying your social media presence back to your main platform so everything is connected."
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "Image Optimization: Alt Text and Context Matter"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "Optimizing images isn''t just about resizing them to keep your site fast—though that''s important. It''s also about adding alt text so search engines and all users can understand your images. Don''t rely on auto-generated descriptions—use AI tools like <a href=\"https://chat.openai.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ChatGPT</a> to craft alt text that''s tailored to your production. This adds real context and boosts your SEO."
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "Looking Ahead: Preparing for AI-Driven Search"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "As AI tools become more common, having an FAQ page is a smart move. It makes it easy for AI to find and share info about you. And if you want to dive deeper into using structured data like JSON-LD, check out <a href=\"https://schema.org/docs/gs.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Schema.org''s Getting Started Guide</a>."
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "Advanced Tips: Collaboration and Structured Data"
  },
  {
    "type": "image",
    "url": "https://files.manuscdn.com/user_upload_by_module/session_file/310519663337866878/pIPkOTIiclbJELBS.png",
    "alt": "Minimalist theatrical stage set with geometric elements floating in digital cloudscape",
    "caption": "Your portfolio is like a stage set—every element should work together to tell your story"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "Finally, consider a collaborations page and structured data to connect all your professional networks. Your website is the central platform linking everything together, representing who you are as a designer."
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "Frequently Asked Questions"
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "Why is alt text important for my portfolio images?"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "Alt text helps with accessibility and SEO. It provides context for search engines and ensures that everyone, including those using screen readers, can understand the content of your images."
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "How often should I update the \"news\" section of my site?"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "You don''t need to update it constantly—just enough to keep your site fresh. Posting updates when you start a new project, when a show opens, or when you receive a review is a great way to keep things current."
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "What''s the benefit of having an FAQ section on my portfolio site?"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "An FAQ section makes it easy for visitors and AI tools to find quick answers about you and your work. It''s another way to enhance your visibility and user-friendliness."
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "Where can I learn more about using JSON-LD for structured data?"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "The best resource for learning about JSON-LD and structured data is <a href=\"https://schema.org/docs/gs.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Schema.org''s official documentation</a>. It provides comprehensive guides and examples for implementing structured data on your website."
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "Should I use a custom domain for my portfolio?"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "Yes, a custom domain (like brandonptdavis.com) looks more professional than a subdomain or free hosting URL. It''s easier to remember, builds your personal brand, and improves SEO. Most domain registrars offer affordable annual rates."
  }
]'
WHERE slug = 'online-portfolio-theatrical-design-2026';

